## ⚙️ Setup Instructions

1. Clone the repository

```
git clone https://github.com/hu17-m/backend-auth-system.git
```

2. Install dependencies

```
npm install
```

3. Configure environment variables
   Create a `.env` file:

```
PORT=5000
MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
```

4. Run the application

```
npx nodemon server.js
```

---

## 💡 Key Concepts Implemented

* Authentication vs Authorization
* JWT token generation and verification
* Middleware-based request handling
* Secure password storage using hashing
* Role-based access control (RBAC)
* Modular backend architecture

---

## 📌 Notes

* Tokens are validated on each protected request
* Role verification ensures restricted access
* Sensitive data like passwords are never exposed in responses

